---
import { Laptop, BriefcaseBusiness, Sparkles } from 'lucide-astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><h1>Hourly remote tech support</h1><p class="lead">Remote help for households and businesses across the United States. Priced by the hour, billed by the minute. No fix, no fee.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Request tech help</a><a class="plain" href="#pricing">See pricing</a></div></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/remote-support.png" alt="Remote support professional working with a laptop and headset" width="1728" height="882" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/><div class="hero-photo-rate">20 minutes at $36/hr costs $12<small>Example of per-minute billing</small></div></div></div></section><section class="block" id="services"><div class="wrap"><h2>Tech support services</h2><p class="section-intro">Remote support for everyday technology, business software and more complex technical tasks.</p><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Laptop size={28} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Personal technology</h3><p>Computers, email, printers, home networking and everyday software.</p><a href="/home-tech/">Learn more →</a></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><BriefcaseBusiness size={28} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Business technology</h3><p>Business email, office software, websites and cloud applications.</p><a href="/business-tech/">Learn more →</a></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Sparkles size={28} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>AI & automation</h3><p>Practical help adopting AI tools and simplifying repetitive work.</p><a href="/ai/">Learn more →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="block pricing" id="pricing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Hourly rates</h2><p class="section-intro">Request a scheduled appointment for a lower rate, or ask about the next available technician. Pay only for the minutes used on a successful repair.</p><div class="price-table-wrap"><table class="price-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Specialty</th><th scope="col">Book a time</th><th scope="col">On demand</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Personal technology</th><td><strong>$36</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$0.60/min</small></td><td><strong>$60</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.00/min</small></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Business software</th><td><strong>$48</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$0.80/min</small></td><td><strong>$84</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.40/min</small></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Advanced IT</th><td><strong>$72</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.20/min</small></td><td><strong>$108</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.80/min</small></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AI & automation</th><td><strong>$96</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.60/min</small></td><td><strong>$144</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$2.40/min</small></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="price-footer"><span>All rates billed by the minute.</span><a href="/contact/">Request tech help →</a></div></div><div class="guarantee"><div><h3>Repair guarantee</h3></div><p>No fix, no fee for eligible repairs. We agree on the problem and rate before starting. If we cannot resolve the agreed repair issue, you pay nothing. For AI implementation, training and other project work, we agree on a specific deliverable and billing terms upfront.</p></div><p class="note">Currently accepting inquiries. Appointments and on-demand assistance are not yet available.</p></div></section><section class="block research"><div class="wrap research-grid"><div><h2>Technology research</h2><p class="section-intro">Our research program will examine how technology affects households, businesses and communities, using public data and transparent methods.</p><a class="plain" href="/research/">Explore our research program →</a></div><div class="research-graphic"><strong>Local and national trends</strong><p>Digital safety · AI adoption · Internet access · Business technology</p></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>How remote support works</h2><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Describe the problem</h3><p>Describe the problem so we can identify the right expertise.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Choose scheduled or on-demand help</h3><p>Book ahead or request immediate help when a technician is available.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Approve scope and rate</h3><p>Approve the scope and rate first. Eligible repairs are covered by our no fix, no fee policy.</p></div></div></div></section></Base>